msgstr "Upozornenie na registráciu DPH"

#. module: l10n_sk_vat_registration
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vat_registration.field_cssk_tax_authority__l10n_sk_vat_registration_category
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vat_registration.field_res_partner__l10n_sk_vat_registration_category
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vat_registration.field_res_users__l10n_sk_vat_registration_category
msgid ""
"The paragraph of the SK VAT Act the partner's IČ DPH was issued under. § 7 "
"and § 7a registrants hold a VIES-valid IČ DPH but are not platitelia dane."
msgstr ""
"Paragraf zákona o DPH, podľa ktorého bolo partnerovi pridelené IČ DPH. Osoby"
" registrované podľa § 7 a § 7a majú IČ DPH platné vo VIES, nie sú však "
"platiteľmi dane."

#. module: l10n_sk_vat_registration
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vat_registration.field_cssk_tax_authority__l10n_sk_is_full_vat_payer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vat_registration.field_res_partner__l10n_sk_is_full_vat_payer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vat_registration.field_res_users__l10n_sk_is_full_vat_payer
msgid ""
"True for a registration under § 4 / § 4b / § 5 / § 6. False for § 7 and § "
"7a, and unset when the category is unknown."
msgstr ""
"Pravda pri registrácii podľa § 4 / § 4b / § 5 / § 6. Nepravda pri § 7 a § 7a"
" a vtedy, keď druh registrácie nie je známy."

